; preludes: form-stdlib/evidence-grounding.fk
;
; evidence-grounding-band — the question-shape, proven on the codes it was born from AND on the
; claims that made it grow two more strata.
;
; A claim = (name observed? independent? measured? derived? refuted?).
;
; PART ONE — the four shamballa light codes the shape was born from (2026-06-09), unchanged in
; meaning, re-ranked onto the six-stratum spectrum:
;   "999"      body<->light  1 1 1 0 0 -> MEASURED 5 (biophotons: a 56-study systematic review;
;                            ultraweak photon emission imaged, diurnal rhythm)
;   "33"       the sun       1 1 1 0 0 -> MEASURED 5 (heliotherapy / circadian / vitamin D)
;   "502"      opalite egg   1 1 0 0 0 -> PRACTICE 3 (documented practice, not measured effect)
;   "777 888"  dragons       0 0 0 0 0 -> MYSTERY  0 (no public observable kernel)
;
; PART TWO — the zero-point ladder (docs/vision-kb/resources/zero-point-plasma-water.md), the
; claim set the original four lanes could not place. Read out of Misner-Thorne-Wheeler,
; Gravitation (1973):
;   "lamb-shift"   1 1 1 0 0 -> MEASURED 5  vacuum fluctuations move the hydrogen electron; the
;                              Lamb-Retherford shift measures it (MTW 43.4, p. 1190). The floor
;                              the whole ladder stands on, and it is ordinary measured physics.
;   "mtw-1e94"     0 0 0 1 0 -> THEORY   4  the vacuum field-fluctuation density 1e94 g/cm3
;                              (p. 1202, quoting Wheeler 1962) — derived from QED + general
;                              relativity, both measured; the density itself never observed.
;   "cole-puthoff" 0 0 0 1 0 -> THEORY   4  vacuum-energy extraction is not forbidden by
;                              thermodynamics for irreversible processes (Phys. Rev. E 48, 1562)
;                              — a peer-reviewed analysis that reports no experiment.
;   "water-car"    1 0 0 0 1 -> CONTESTED 1 running an engine on electrolysed water: claimed,
;                              replication attempted and failed across a long history. A
;                              testable kernel exists and it was tested — that is why it is
;                              contested and not mystery.
;
; THE TWO NEW STRATA EARN THEIR PLACE BY WHAT THEY DO, NOT BY BEING NAMED:
;   THEORY grows tissue — mtw-1e94 is citable, and the body does cite it.
;   CONTESTED grows none — water-car is held and named, never grown into a concept that asserts.
;   Neither could be said with four lanes: mtw-1e94 has observed?=0 and would have fallen to
;   MYSTERY (honest absence for a standard-textbook derivation), and water-car would have been
;   INFERENCE, indistinguishable from a claim nobody had tried yet.
;
; surface across all eight: 6 grow tissue (3 measured + 2 theory + 1 practice), 2 held below
; (1 contested + 1 mystery) — never fabricated upward, never buried.
;
; Verdict 8191 when every classification lands:
;    1  999 lands in MEASURED             64  lamb-shift lands in MEASURED
;    2  502 lands in PRACTICE            128  mtw-1e94 grows tissue (theory is citable)
;    4  dragons lands in MYSTERY         256  water-car grows NO tissue (contested is held)
;    8  mtw-1e94 lands in THEORY         512  dragons is honest absence
;   16  cole-puthoff lands in THEORY    1024  water-car reads as contested
;   32  water-car lands in CONTESTED    2048  surface: 6 grown, 2 held
;                                       4096  33 lands in MEASURED
(do
    (let claims (list
        (list "999"          1 1 1 0 0)
        (list "33"           1 1 1 0 0)
        (list "502"          1 1 0 0 0)
        (list "777 888"      0 0 0 0 0)
        (list "lamb-shift"   1 1 1 0 0)
        (list "mtw-1e94"     0 0 0 1 0)
        (list "cole-puthoff" 0 0 0 1 0)
        (list "water-car"    1 0 0 0 1)))
    (let c999   (nth claims 0))
    (let c33    (nth claims 1))
    (let c502   (nth claims 2))
    (let cdrag  (nth claims 3))
    (let clamb  (nth claims 4))
    (let cmtw   (nth claims 5))
    (let ccp    (nth claims 6))
    (let cwater (nth claims 7))
    (let s (eg-surface claims 0 0))
    (let v0  (if (eq (eg-lane c999) 5) 1 0))
    (let v1  (if (eq (eg-lane c502) 3) 2 0))
    (let v2  (if (eq (eg-lane cdrag) 0) 4 0))
    (let v3  (if (eq (eg-lane cmtw) 4) 8 0))
    (let v4  (if (eq (eg-lane ccp) 4) 16 0))
    (let v5  (if (eq (eg-lane cwater) 1) 32 0))
    (let v6  (if (eq (eg-lane clamb) 5) 64 0))
    (let v7  (if (eq (eg-forms? cmtw) 1) 128 0))
    (let v8  (if (eq (eg-forms? cwater) 0) 256 0))
    (let v9  (if (eq (eg-honest-absence? cdrag) 1) 512 0))
    (let v10 (if (eq (eg-contested? cwater) 1) 1024 0))
    (let v11 (if (and (eq (eg-grown s) 6) (eq (eg-held s) 2)) 2048 0))
    (let v12 (if (eq (eg-lane c33) 5) 4096 0))
    (add v0 (add v1 (add v2 (add v3 (add v4 (add v5 (add v6 (add v7 (add v8 (add v9 (add v10 (add v11 v12)))))))))))))
